{% set resetUrl = "http://localhost:4200/reset-password?token=" ~ (resetToken.token|url_encode) %}

<h1>Reset your password</h1>

<p>We received a request to reset your password.</p>

<p><a href="{{ resetUrl }}">Choose a new password</a></p>

<p>This link expires in {{resetToken.expirationMessageKey|trans(resetToken.expirationMessageData, "ResetPasswordBundle")}}</p>

<p>If you didn’t request a reset, you can ignore this email.</p>